t342,346/PDF354,358; local structural check"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal F_\\omega\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal F_\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V_\\sigma\">\\(x\\in V_\\sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathcal T_\\sigma\">\\(t\\in\\mathcal T_\\sigma\\)</span>，带类型的避免捕获代入与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^N\">\\(A^N\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dfc104a5d3297ad\" href=\"?note=0dfc104a5d3297ad\" title=\"72-df-dialectica-translation\">72-df-dialectica-translation</a> 的同一负翻译；公式按既定α等价类读取，所有新鲜变量均取相应类型。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(A^N)=\\operatorname{FV}(A),\\qquad (A[t/x])^N=(A^N)[t/x].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(A^N)=\\operatorname{FV}(A),\\qquad (A[t/x])^N=(A^N)[t/x].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按公式树归纳。原子双重否定只增加闭的假公式和蕴涵节点；合取、蕴涵直接保持；析取的否定合取展开只复用两支；全称与存在翻译保留同一绑定者。遇到捕获冲突时，两边先选同一个避开有限变量集的同类型新变量，归纳结果在α类上相等。这不是自由字符串层面的任意改名相等，依赖上游已经明确的取商约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[A